      "status": 200,
      "body": "# Tubidy\n\n> Tubidy is a music download website that helps users search for songs, artists, and music videos and access available MP3 and MP4 formats through a simple interface.\n\nTubidy's canonical website is [https://tubidy.llc/](https://tubidy.llc/). Its primary language is English, with a focus on South African music discovery.\n\n## Core functions\n\n- [Search music, artists, songs, and music video titles](https://tubidy.llc/)\n- Review individual music or video results before choosing an available format.\n- Access MP3 audio and MP4 video options when provided for a selected result.\n- Browse music trends, moods, genres, and South African selections.\n\n## Key pages\n\n- [Article archive](https://tubidy.llc/article/): Native editorial articles about music search, music discovery, and available download formats.\n- [About and editorial transparency](https://tubidy.llc/page/about/): Service identity, editorial approach, corrections, and responsible-use information.\n- [Frequently asked questions](https://tubidy.llc/page/faq/): Answers about using Tubidy search and available formats.\n- [Terms](https://tubidy.llc/page/terms/): Terms governing use of the website.\n- [DMCA process](https://tubidy.llc/page/dmca/): Copyright notification process.\n- [Contact](https://tubidy.llc/page/contact/): Contact information for Tubidy.\n\n## Content and citation notes\n\n- Search and download result pages are dynamic and can change as source availability changes.\n- File format, quality, size, and availability should be verified on the selected result page.\n- Editorial articles are stored as native files and expose published and modified dates.\n- Users are responsible for following applicable copyright law and obtaining permission where required.\n",
      "url": "https://m.tubidy.llc/llms.txt"
    },
